From e6b0fff28e17078f3f69b91edcc816896771f034 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aignis <6974796+aignis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:02:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] switch2: build for Switch 2 (kaiHEN) with an SDL3 subset
 on libnx

NINTENDO_SWITCH2 (libounce toolchain) builds ctr-native.nro. SDL3 has no
Switch platform, so platform/switch2/sdl3_switch2.c implements the SDL3
calls this tree makes, against SDL3's own headers: EGL on the default
NWindow, libnx pad for four players, audren for audio, armGetSystemTick.
-fsigned-char because the PS1 code assumes a signed char.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
